  ],
  "notes": "{固定|こてい} means to fix or secure something in place so it does not move.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {固定|こてい}する (to fix, to secure)\n- {固定|こてい}される (to be fixed/secured)\n- {固定|こてい}{電話|でんわ} (landline phone — literally \"fixed telephone\")\n- {固定|こてい}{費|ひ} (fixed costs)\n- {固定|こてい}{資産|しさん} (fixed assets)\n\nThe opposite is {移動|いどう} (moving, portable).",
